  "prefLabel": "Plc 311.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 311.01 Purpose. This purpose of this part is to establish standard procedures for conducting disciplinary or non-disciplinary remedial proceedings and imposing license conditions.\n\nSource. #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300)",
